    "title": "What Is a Forward-Deployed Engineer? 3 Mistakes and 3 Best Practices",
    "description": "A practical guide to what forward-deployed engineers do, where the model breaks, and how to structure a 90-day engagement that leaves your team in control.",
    "publishedDate": "2026-08-18",
